accomplish
ACCOMPLISH (v. t.):
I To complete: q. v.
पूरयति (c. of पूर्).
II To perform, execute:
(1) साधयति (c. of सिध्);
(2) निष्पादयति, सम्पा-
दयति (c. of पद्);
(3) निवर्तयति (c. of वृत्);
(4) [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=007" target="_blank">Page007</a>]
समा-दधाति (धा, c. 3);
(5) करोति (कृ, c. 8);
(6) दिशति (दिश्, c. 9);
(7) राधयति (c. of.
राध्).
III To furnish: q. v.
