application
APPLICATION (subs).:
I The act of putting to:
प्रयोगः, सम्प्रयोगः,
by the a. of fire or heat
अग्न्यातप-
संप्रयोगात्, R. v. 54.
II The thing applied:
प्रयोगः, should seize (them)
by wet leather or by
other a. s
आर्द्र चर्मणान्यैर्वा प्रयोगैर्गृह्वीयात्, Sr.
III
Petition: q. v.:
(1) प्रार्थना;
(2) याच्ञा।
IV
attention, assiduity: q. v.:
(1) अभिनिवेशः;
(2) मनोयोगः। V. Use, employment; प्रयोगः Ki.
VI Relation, reference: q. v.
