apply
APPLY (v. i.):
I Refer or relate to:
(1)
लगति (लग्, c. 1) (with loc.) N. xiii. 8.;
(2)
वर्तते (वृत्, c. 1) (only in certain cases),
here
the word ‘light’ a. s to God
अत्र ज्योतिःशब्दः
 ब्रह्मणि वर्तते, S. iii. 40.
II To solicit, have
recourse to: q. v.: प्रार्थयते (अर्थ्, c. 10.).
