or
यंक्ते, नि-, विनि-, (युज्, c. 7), as [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=034" target="_blank">Page034</a>]
a king a. s officers over villages etc.
यथा, राजा
 ग्रामादिष्वधिकृतान्विनियुंक्ते, Up.;
