create). even an iota of master's favour
arrogance among unsteady (people) जनयति
 प्रभुप्रसादलवोऽपि प्रागल्भ्यमधीरप्रकृतेः, K.;
(3)
circumlo.:
this will c. his death
अनेन तस्य
 भविष्यति;
ascertaining that the dropping of
