clothe
CLOTHE (v.):
I To put on c. s:
c. ing her-
self:
गृहीतवस्त्रा, Ku.;
c. ing himself:
परिधाय
 वाससी, K.: v. To put on clothes.
II To
invest with raiment: वस्त्रं etc. परिधापयति (c.
of धा)
or
वासयति (c. of वस्).
III To pro-
-vide with c. s: but should feed and c. her:
ग्रासाच्छादनन्तु देयमेव, K. b.
IV To cover or
invest: q. v.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a>
