(6) निरुष्णः (ष्णा, ष्णं),
अघर्मः (र्मा। र्मं) etc. (poet). C. season:
(1) हेमन्त
(mn.) (from about the middle of November
to about the m. of January);
(2) शिशिर (mn.)
(from a. the m. of J. to a. the m. of March).
