consequence
CONSEQUENCE:
I Result, effect: q. v.: फलम्,
of evil c. s:
अनिष्टफलः (ला, लं), Mu. Ph.: in c.
of: v. For, account of, on;
the c. of which
was:
ततः
or
अतः।
II Logical: निगमनम्।
III
Importance. Ph.:
of no c.
निरर्थकः (का, कं);
a matter of great c.
गुर्वर्थः;
doing what is of
little c.:
यत्किञ्चनकारिता, K.
