courtesy
COURTESY:
I Courteousness:
(1) दाक्षिण्यम्,
by
her politeness^1, c., and affability:
तस्या विनयेन
 दाक्षिण्येन मधुरालापितया। K.;
(2) विनयः;
(3)
प्रश्रयः,
accepted with c.:
सप्रश्रयं प्रतिजग्राह, K.;
(4) सौजन्यम्। c., agreeable as free from arrogance:
अपगताभिमानमधुरा सुजनता। K.
II An act of c.:
उपचारः,
by c. s to the invited ladies:
उपचारेण
 निमन्त्रितस्त्रीषु, C.
III A bow: प्रणामः, R. vi. 25.
[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.
