 समर्प्य, K. : v. To give. Ph.: d. (this) back
to him: [इदं] तस्मै प्रतिनिर्यातय, Mr. iv.: v. To
give back.
III To utter, pronounce:
q. v.:
(1) उदीरयति (ईर्, c. 10.);
