<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

departed
DEPARTED (adj.): i. e. dead: q. v.
(1) दिवं
 गतः (ता, तं) (i. e. gone to heaven; of great
men), Raj.;
(2) परलोकगतः (ता, तं), Mu.
