<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dependence
DEPENDENCE:
I Suspension: q. v.
II
Connexion: q. v.: सम्बन्धः।
III Reliance:
q. v.: विश्वास।
IV A state of subjection:
(1) अधीनता;
(2) आयत्तता;
(3) निघ्नता (rare).
V. That on which one depends:
(1) आश्रयः;
(2) अवलम्बनम्।
