disposal
DISPOSAL:
I Arrangement: q. v.:
(1)
विन्यासः;
(2) विरचना।
II Regulation,
management: q. v.: निर्वाहः।
III Bestowal:
q. v.
IV Power, control, pleasure: q. v.:
Ph.:
since I saw you, I am at your d.:
दर्शनात्
 प्रभृति परवानयं जनः, K.;
this is at your d.:
अत्र
 प्रभवति (भू, c. 1.) भवती।
