II To
give a claim to: expr. by अधिकारः
or
अर्हति
(अर्ह्, c. 1.)
or
-भाज् (mfn.) in comp.,
who
are not e. d to share:
विभागानधिकारिणः, Mit.;
how is the youngest e. d to the kingdom in pre-
ference to the eldest:
कथं ज्येष्ठमतिक्रम्य कनीयान्
 राज्यमर्हति, Mat.;
in the absence of the former, the
latter is e. d to property:
पूर्वस्याभावे धनभागुत्तरः, Y.
