<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

excellence
EXCELLENCE:
I Superiority:
(1) उत्कर्षः or
प्रकर्षः;
(2) उत्कृष्टता;
(3) विशिष्टता: v. Also
greatness, loftiness.
II Any good quality:
गुणः
or
महद्गुणः
or
विशिष्टगुणः।
