III To denote: q. v.: वक्ति (वच्, c. 2.),
here the word beast is intended to e. illiberal:
अत्र जन्तुपदमदातर्यर्थे विवक्षितम्, Kav.
IV To
declare, speak: q. v.: वक्ति, what he was [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=259" target="_blank">Page259</a>]
about to e.:
विवक्षितां गिरम्, Si.
V To send: q. v.:
विसृजति (सृज्, c. 6.).
VI To represent: q. v.
