धिरोहणोचितः (ता, तं), K.;
(3) क्षमः (मा, मं) [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=281" target="_blank">Page281</a>]
(= able, adequate),
dress f. for going to
hunting fields:
