(1) अवैधः (धा, धं) (= against
rule): v. Regular;
(2) विषमः (मा, मं) (= un-
-even: as of motion);
(3) उच्छृङ्ललः (ला, लं)
(in conduct). In gram.: perh. विशेष-; निपातितः
(ता, तं), Wilson.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irregularity
IRREGULARITY:
I In gen.:
(1) अवैधता;
(2)
वैषन्म्यम् (as of motion).
II In gram.: निपातनम्
(?).
