with the n. turned up:
उद्ग्रीव
(f. वा), Ki. vii. 22.;
(2) गलः,
putting his
feet on our n.s:
कृत्वा पदं नो गले, Mu. iii.; who
will seize him by the n. (and turn him out): य
 एनं गलहस्तयति, H. iii.
