(3) कणठः (= throat),
like a medal
on his n.:
अस्य कण्ठे निष्कमिव, Ku. ii. 49.;
(4) कन्धरा (rare);
(5) शिरोधरा (poet.).
II Of a
vessel: गलः।
III Of land: भूमागः।
N.
break:
गलग्रहः; N. and crop: v. Completely,
utterly.
On the n. of:
उपकण्ठम् (with gen.):
v. After.
