notice
NOTICE (v.):
I To observe, see: लक्षयति,
 आ-, सं, अभि-, समा- (लक्ष्, c. 10.), did not n.:
नालक्षयत्, Ku. iii. 51.
II To remark upon:
विवृणोति (वृ, c. 5.) (= to explain): निर्दिशति
(दिश्, c. 6.)
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=476" target="_blank">PDF</a>
