offer
OFFER (v. t.):
I To present as a sacrifice:
(1) उपहारं करोति
or
ददाति,
if you o. your own
son to the goddess:
यदि त्वमात्मनः पुत्रं भगवत्या
 उपहारीकरोषि, H. iii.;
(2) उपढौकते (ढौक्,
c. 1 (not religiously),
o. ed this body to
Garuḍa:
गरूडाय स्वेदहमुपढौकितवान्, Vet. xiii.; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=485" target="_blank">Page485</a>]
(3) उपनयति (नी, c. 1.);
o. ed his body to the
lion:
हरये स्वदेहमुपानयत्, R. ii. 59.
II To the
mind: उदेति (इ, c. 2.): v. To occur,
arise.
III To propose: q.v.: उपन्यस्यति
(अस्, c. 4 (?).
IV To bid: दित्सति (desi.
दा).
V To make use of: करोति, o. violence:
बलात्कारं करोति;
o. prayers:
स्तवं करोति। Ph.:
to o. hand (in friendship): बाहुं प्रसारयति, Ram.
