<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

once
ONCE, AT:
I. At the same time:
(1) युगपत्;
(2) समकालम्;
(3) एकावसरम्;
(4) समम्, Ki.
Ph.:
at o. perspicuous and deep:
प्रसन्नगम्भीरः
(रा, रं), Ki.;
at o. terrific and pleasant:
भीम-
कान्तः (न्ता, न्तं), B.
II. Immediately: q.v.:
(1) सद्यः;
(2) तत्क्षणात्।
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=487" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

