<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

order
ORDER (v.):
I To arrange, dispose: q. v.:
परिकल्पयति (कॢप्, c. 10.).
II To command,
direct:
(2) आ-दिशति, नि-, समा-, (दिश्, c. 6.),
I have been o. ed by the Princess of Benares:
आदिष्टोऽस्मि काशिराजपुत्र्या, V. iii.;
(2) आज्ञापयति,
 सम्-, (c. of ज्ञा),
as your Majesty o. s.:
यदाज्ञा-
पयति देवः, Mah.;
o. the forces to eradicate (his)
resolution:
संकल्पसमुन्मूलनाय दण्डचक्रमाज्ञापय, Mah.
i.;
(3) शास्ति (शास्, c. 2 (ambiguous).
