partaker
PARTAKER:
(1) अंशिन् (f. नी = sharer: q. v.);
(2) -भाज् (mfn.), in comp., p. of your distress:
तव दुःखभाक्;
(3) by comp.,
your boon com-
panions are equal p. s of your pleasures and
pains:
समदुःखसुखः सखीजनः, R. viii. 65.
