PASS BY:
I Lit.: expr. by अतिक्रामति
or
अत्येति
and words signifying near,
although you p.
by (me), you do not cast a look:
समीपेऽप्यति-
क्रामन्तीतो दृष्टिं न ददासि, Mal. i.
II Of time:
अत्योति (इ, c. 2.): v. Pass away.
