 प्र-, अभि-, (चि, c. 5.).
II To pick: q. v.
III Of the teeth: उल्लिखति (लिख्, c. 6.).
IV To pierce: q. v.: विध्यति (व्यध्,) c. 4.).
Ph.: (a)
to p. one's purse:
धनभस्त्रिकां मुष्णाति;
(b)
p. holes in one's coat:
परस्य छिद्राणि समाहरति;
(c)
p. a quarrel:
कलहम् उत्थापयति। Comp.s.:
(a)
P. off:
उद्धरति (हृ, c. 1.): v. Also to
separate. (b)
P. out:
आहरति with expr. s
meaning from or among: v. Also to choose.
(c)
P. up:
समाहरति: v. To gather.
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a>
<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

