pledge
PLEDGE (subs.):
I Pawn, mortgage: q. v.:
आधिः।
II Any security: perh. बन्धः,
the
mutual affection of husband and wife is a p.
against separation:
जायापत्योः परस्परप्रणयस्तयो-
रविच्छेदबन्धः;
to take p.:
प्रतिज्ञां करोति।
III A
surety: q. v.: प्रतिभूः।
