prefer
PREFER:
I To offer, address: to p. a charge:
अभियोगं करोति
or
निवेदयति (= to inform).
II
To advance, raise: q. v.: उन्नमयति (c. of
नम्),
p. your friends:
उन्नमय स्वबन्धुवर्गम्, Ki.
III
To regard more: बहु (much)
or
अधिकम्
(more) मन्यते (मन्, c. 4.): v. Also to excel.
IV To like more: अधिकं रोचते (रुच्, c. 1.:
with dat. of the person): v. Also better.
