present
PRESENT (v.):
I To give freely:
(1) उपहरति
(हृ, c. 1.). what the infallible (Kṛṣṇa) p. ed:
यदुपाहरदच्युतः, Mah. iv. 72. 39.;
(2) उपढौकते
(ढौक्, c. 1.): v. To offer;
(3) उपहारं etc.
ददाति (दा, c. 3.): v. Subs.
II To high
officers: दर्शनं कारयति (c. of कृ: with gen.).
III To p. oneself: उपतिष्ठते (स्था, c. 1. = to
attend on).
IV To exhibit, shew: q. v.:
प्रदर्शयति (c. of दृश्);
to p. arms:
अस्त्राणि परि-
दर्शयति (?).
V To give, deliver: q. v.: ददाति।
Ph.:
p. a false appearance of:
विडम्बयति, R.
xvi. 11.
