<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

proverb
PROVERB: जनप्रवादः, लोकवादः, and sim. comp.s.:
the p. that shame is only in the eye:
अक्षिलज्जेति
 जनप्रवादः, N. xiv. 30; as the common p. is if
you can get honey in the swallow wort, why [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=554" target="_blank">Page554</a>]
should you go to the mountains:
तथा च
 लौकिकानामाभाणकः” अर्के चेन्मधु विन्देत किमर्थं पर्वतं
 व्रजेत्”, T.;
there is the p. the state of the mind
bespeaks of coming pleasure or pain:
अस्ति खलु
 लोकप्रवादः ‘आगामि सुखं दुःखं वा हृदयसमवस्था कथयती ति,
Mal. v.
