put out
PUT OUT:
I As the tongue: बहिष्करोति।
II
To stretch: q. v.: प्रसारयति (c. of सृ).
III
To dislocate: q. v.
IV To turn out:
q. v.: बहिष्करोति।
V As the eyes:
(1) उद्धरति,
 सम्-, (हृ, c. 1.), D.;
