RETURN, IN: प्रति- in comp.
If I do not do some
good to you in r.:
प्रतिप्रियं चेद्भवतो न कुर्याम्, R. v.
56.;
Ś. has done befitting^1 good to f. in r. for
his life:
प्राणप्रदस्य सुसदृशं प्रत्युपकृतं जीमूतवाहनस्य
 शङ्खचूडेन, Na. v.;
action in r.:
प्रतिक्रिया,
Mr. iii.
[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.
