<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

seat
SEAT (v.):
I To s. oneself: आसने उपविशति,
 सम्-, (विश्, c. 6.), निषीदति (सद्, c. 1.), etc.
II To s. another: आसने उपवेशयति (c. of
विश्)
or
