settle
SETTLE (v. i.):
I To fall to the bottom: तले
 पतति (पत्, c. 1.).
II To become fixed:
(1) स्थिरीभवति;
(2) व्यवतिष्ठते (स्था, c. 1.: rare). [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=632" target="_blank">Page632</a>]
III To fix one's habitation:
(1) निवासं
 स्थिरीकरोति;
