subject
SUBJECT (v.):
I To subjugate: q. v.: वशी-
करोति।
II To expose, make liable: expr.
by circumlo., cowardice s. s people in danger:
विपदोऽभिभवन्त्यविक्रमम्, Ki. ii. 14.;
foolish men
s. themselves to passion:
मूढो मदनेनायास्यते, K.;
God, without any effort, s. s men to ridicule:
अयत्नेनैव खलूपहासास्पदतामीश्वरो नयति, K.: v.
Also to attack, possess.
