taste of
TASTE OF (v.t.):
I To taste: q. v.: रसयति।
II To smack of:
(1) स्वदते with an adj. or
adv.,
t. s of garlic:
सलशुनः (ना, नं) स्वदते;
(2)
by comp. with स्वाद (= flavour).
