<a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tear
TEAR (v.):
I To rend, shatter: q. v.:
विदारयति (दॄ, c. 10.).
II As letters: छिनत्ति
(छिद्, c. 7. = to cut),
torn garment:
छिन्नं
 वस्रम्; t.s away (or off) in our presence:
मिषतामाच्छिनत्ति नः, Ku. ii. 46.
III To pluck,
pull: q. v.
IV Move violently: धावति,
 परि- (धाव्, c. 1.). Ph.:
t. open:
छित्वा
 उन्मुञ्चति (मुच्, c. 6.): v. To open.
