turn
TURN (v. t.):
I To revolve, roll: q. v.: घूर्णयति
(c. of घूर्ण्).
II To change: q. v.: परि-
वर्तयति (c. of वृत्).
III To reverse: q. v.:
विपर्यासयति (c. of अस).
IV To adopt,
divert, utilize: q. v.: to t. into good account:
सफलीकरोतिः;
to t. into ashes:
भस्मीकरोति;
to. t.
into some use:
उपयोजयति;
to t. one's eyes:
नेत्रं
 पातयति;
to t. one's attention:
अवधानं ददाति;
to
t. the back:
पृष्ठं दर्शयति: v. To shape, form:
q. v.
